{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7Jc29Fp13Cx3YLiGsZF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your answers would change what the pitch says:\n\n1. **What are the cinema and the town called, and is there one detail people remember about the place?** For example a long-serving projectionist, a seat everyone fought over, or a film that sold out for weeks. One real memory will do more than any adjective I could write.\n2. **Why did it close in 2022, and why will it stay open this time?** Readers will wonder whether it can pay its way. It would help to know your rough break-even, such as \"we need X tickets a week at $Y\", and whether volunteer staffing is what makes the numbers work.\n3. **What's different from the campaign three years ago, besides the bank's pledge?** Did the $120,000 cover things you've since dropped, or did the price come down? Many backers will remember the refund, so I'd rather speak to it plainly than avoid it.\n4. **How does the money work if you fall short?** Is it all-or-nothing with full refunds again? Are there reward tiers, like founding-member passes, named seats or a free ticket?\n5. **Is the deadline June 30, 2027?** And is the target from backers exactly $60,000, or are you aiming higher for a cushion?\n\nIf you don't know some of these, say so. I'll write around the gaps rather than guess."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_read_input_tokens":9519,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":357},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"32a829cd-a10c-4e72-8ba5-629b167a2a63","uuid":"15d5e5db-e717-4b5f-acb3-148fa3cf1c16","timestamp":"2026-